{"unit_id":"SilverCrossing__outside-access-guard#card-zh","repo":"SilverCrossing/outside-access-guard","commit":"6d720b046aa7d7fa417afcd28f086e67908ae0ff","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"outside-access-guard（DSH 插件，通用客户端）：为 DSH 工具调用增加工作区外路径访问控制。它挂接工具执行前流程，按拒绝、逐次审批或放行模式处理文件与 shell 调用，并可按工作区和会话分别配置模式。主要功能包括识别常见文件路径和 shell 路径表达式、对敏感路径要求二次确认、提供会话级模式命令，以及记录每日判定和审批结果。适合希望在 DSH 中管理工作区外工具访问的用户。无需 API 密钥或外部服务；可配置本地日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:324-465","classify.js:1-120","log.js:47-105"]}
{"unit_id":"SilverCrossing__outside-access-guard#card-en","repo":"SilverCrossing/outside-access-guard","commit":"6d720b046aa7d7fa417afcd28f086e67908ae0ff","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"outside-access-guard gates DSH tool calls beyond the session workspace. It can deny, request approval, or allow access. Sensitive paths can require a second confirmation. A session command changes the mode, and decisions are logged locally each day. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:324-465","classify.js:1-120","log.js:47-105"]}
